                    <msContents>
                       <summary/>
                       <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">                        
                           <title type="complete" cert="medium" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2382Taamme">Miracles of Jesus</title>
                         <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
                           <colophon xml:lang="gez" xml:id="coloph1">                             
                               ስብሐት፡ ለእግዚአብሔር፡ ዘአፈጸመኑ፡ በዳኅና፡ ወበሰላም፨ ዘንተ፡ መጽሐፈ፤ ወይትአኰት፡ ስሙ፡ 
                               እስከ፡ ለዓለም፨ አሜን፡ ለይኩን፨፨፨ 
                               ለዘአጽሐፎ፡ መፍቀሬ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ወልደ፡ ሳሙኤል፡ 
                               ወለዘጸሐፎ፡ ጽድቀ፡ አሚን፡ ኅቡረ፡ ይምሐሮሙ፡ በመንግሥተ፡ ሰማያት፡ ለዓለመ፡ ዓለም፡ አሜን፨                                
                               በ<date>፸፻፡ ወ፪፻፡ ፹፡ ወ፱ዓመተ፡ ዓለም፡</date> በዘመነ፡ ማቴዎስ፡ ወበመንግሥተ፡ 
                               <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS8421Salomon">ንጉሥነ፡ <hi rend="rub">ሰሎሞን፡</hi></persName> ተጽሕፈ፤ 
                               ወፍጻሜሁ፡ አመ፡ ፯፡ ለሐምሌ፨ 
                               በዕለተ፡ ረቡዕ፨  ወ<persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10450YosabI">ጳጳስሂ፡ አቡነ፡ <hi rend="rub">ዮሳብ፨</hi></persName>
                               <note>The colophon mentions the exact date of the completion of the manuscript which is 
                                   equivalent to 12 July 1777 CE (with a slight discrepancy in the Ethiopic date), during the reign of <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS8421Salomon"> King Salomon</persName> and the 
                                   tenure of <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10450YosabI">Metropolitan 
                                       Yosāb II</persName>. 
                               </note>     
                           </colophon> 
                           </msItem>
                                                                     
                        </msContents>
