                       <handDesc>
                           <handNote xml:id="h1" script="Ethiopic">
                               <seg type="script">Eighteenth-century script.</seg>
                               <seg type="ink">Black, red.</seg>
                               <desc>Careful, regular; by a good scribe. From a certain point the scribe used smaller script 
                                   (a change of hand cannot be excluded). The name of the scribe is Ṣǝdqa ʾAmin.</desc>
                           </handNote>                              
