                      <history>
                         <origin>
                           <origDate when="1777">12 July 1777 CE.</origDate>
                             The date is according to <ref target="#coloph1"/> The manuscript was commissioned by Walda Sāmuʾel and written by the 
                             scribe Ṣǝdqa ʾAmin, during the reign of 
                             <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS8421Salomon">King Salomon</persName> and the 
                             tenure of <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10450YosabI">Metropolitan Yosāb II</persName>
                             </origin>
                          <acquisition>
                            Name of further owners are mentioned on some folia of the book, in secondary hands, 
                            such as mamhǝr Takla Giyorgis, Walatta Hāymanot, ʾƎgziʾ Ḫārayā, Walda ʿĀbiya ʾƎgziʾ.
                            
                          </acquisition>
                      </history>
